  "title": "Grilled Stuffed Swordfish",
  "description": "Swordfish is marinated in white wine and soy sauce flavored with ginger, then stuffed with arugula and tomato and grilled for a fresh, hot, summer meal.",
  "authors": [
    "STORMYSCARLETT"
  ],
